in\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <br /> Anyways, I agree that Michael would be better suited to a Fairest instead of an ogre, especially since the Loony Toons were pretty much relying on him to save their asses from galactic slavery. He comes in, trains them to be good athletes, they put all their hopes upon him. Let's face it, he was their hero, clearly Fairest material.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}